Description: G Unity⁷ desktop
 The Unity7 desktop with the changes from the gentoo-unity7 overlay: the Unity
 shell on cinnamon-session with Nemo, the indicators, lenses and scopes, Unity
 Control Center and Unity Greeter.
 .
 This metapackage depends on the desktop components and recommends the
 applications that the overlay installs by default.
 .
 g-unity7-cleanup removes the Ubuntu Unity packages that G Unity⁷ replaces:
 duplicate applications and other installed alternatives.
